**HEP** & High Energy Physics \\
**HPSS** & High Performance Storage System. Collection of hardware designed for \\  & high-speed high-storage capacity; see section 4. \\
**MWPC** & Multi-Wire Proportional Chamber. Readout system employed by the \\  & TPC. \\
**P10** & TPC gas mixture of 90% Argon + 10% Methane; see section 5.2.1. \\
